  "id": "auc",
  "term": "AUC",
  "definition": "AUC stands for area under the curve, a statistical summary that combines a series of measurements from one person into a single value. In clinical pharmacology, it is often used to represent total drug exposure over time and to compare how available the same drug is across different products.",
